    "name": "Regal Branded Phone Numbers API",
    "description": "Branded Phone Numbers in Regal control how a tenant's outbound numbers appear on recipients' devices via carrier-level branded caller ID and spam remediation. Each registration ties a phoneNumber to a businessProfileId and a carrierFeatures array describing which features (spamRemediation or brandedCallerId) are enabled per carrier. POST is used for first-time registration only; PATCH is used for partial updates; DELETE removes a registration once all carrier submissions are inactive.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Regal Support\n Email: support@regal.ai",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2026-07-28T02:44:08.000Z",
